    "lawCode": "Amd §54.40, Loc Fin L",
    "lawSection": "Local Finance Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8859\n\nSPONSOR: STEWART-COUSINS\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the local finance law, in relation to bonds and notes of\nthe city of Yonkers\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nThe purpose of this law is to extend the authorization for the city of\nYonkers to issue serial bonds and notes until June 30, 2027.\n\n \nSUMMARY OF SPECIFIC PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 of the bill amends existing law to extend authorization for\nthe City of Yonkers to issue serial bonds and notes through negotiated\nsale until June 30, 2027.\n\nSection 2 is the effective date.\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nExtender law - this bill extends the marketing limitation on serial\nbonds/notes of Yonkers from June 30, 2026 to June 30, 2027. The authori-\nzation for Yonkers to negotiate the private sales of its bonds or notes\nis vital to improving the city's financial stability and independence.\nThe city's bonding authority will expire on June 30, 2026 unless it is\nextended for one year. The continuation of this power will allow more\ncost-effective financing for the city of Yonkers.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\n2025 S433 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 136\n\n2024 S8899 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 131\n\n2023 S400 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 168\n\n2022 S8387 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 332\n\n2021 S1033 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 168\n\n2020 S7508B (Budget);Chapter 58\n\n2019 S3405 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 71\n\n2018 S7352 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 81\n\n2017 S6720 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 44\n\n2016 S6355 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 45\n\n2015 S3463 (Stewart-Cousins);Chapter 21\n\n2014 S6313 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 70\n\n2013 S3020 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 69\n\n2012 S6460 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 72\n\n2011 S2982 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 66\n\n2010 S6720 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 125\n\n2009 S3336 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 77\n\n2008 S6878 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 144\n\n2007 S4137 (Stewart-Cousins); Chapter 80\n\n2006 S6701 (Spano); Chapter 122\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
